      "TEXT": "Texte Inthuric",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nain \n\u0022Gymner Gardenuages est le fils du Haut-Roi des Clans des Nains, Morok. Si vous ne touchez ne serait-ce qu\u0027\u00E0 un seul de ses cheveux, Morok vous an\u00E9antira !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN0023",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Texte Oghock",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gobelin \n\u0022Encore vous ? Vous tous mourir ! Grossache tous vous tuer !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Texte Dunera",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Adepte \n\u0022Plus vite, ma\u00EEtre ! Le Ma\u00EEtre-Sage ne doit pas sceller le Portail... Nous devons lib\u00E9rer Bethrezen !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN0027",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner T30",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Conseiller \n\u0022Ma\u00EEtre ! Nos \u00E9claireurs rapportent que Gymner approche du portail... Il va bient\u00F4t entamer la c\u00E9r\u00E9monie qui sera notre perte ! Il faut \u00E0 tout prix l\u0027arr\u00EAter !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN0029",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN002a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Leif",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Enter dans zone 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "G\u00E9ant des collines \n\u0022Wotan ne saurait tol\u00E9rer ce sacril\u00E8ge ! Pr\u00E9parez-vous \u00E0 rejoindre votre maudit dieu dans le n\u00E9ant infini !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN002b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Enter dans zone 2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "G\u00E9ant des collines \n\u0022Wotan ne vous permettra pas de rester sur ces terres, vermine h\u00E9r\u00E9tique ! Il nous m\u00E8nera \u00E0 la victoire !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nains \u00E9m\u00E9ch\u00E9s",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thurin le garde \n\u0022Har ! Pourquoi envoient-ils Gymner ici ? La chasse aux trolls \u00E0 Gunthera va nous manquer...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nain \n\u0022Bah... Qui sait ? Nous sommes cens\u00E9s prot\u00E9ger Gymner en vue d\u0027une c\u00E9r\u00E9monie quelconque. Les corv\u00E9es, c\u0027est toujours pour nous...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thurin le garde\n\u0022Passe-moi donc la bi\u00E8re... Tant qu\u0027\u00E0 garder ce satan\u00E9 portail, autant prendre du bon temps !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Adepte \n\u0022Nous avons surpris un conversation entre des Nains ivres, ma\u00EEtre. Ils gardent le passage qui m\u00E8ne au Portail !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN002d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Avertissement de Gobelin 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Adepte \n\u0022Cette r\u00E9gion est infest\u00E9e de gobelins, ma\u00EEtre ! Nous ne savons pas quelles autres cr\u00E9atures les accompagnent... Il vaudrait mieux rester sur nos gardes...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Victoire qu\u00EAte 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Duc \n\u0022Nous avons accompli notre t\u00E2che, ma\u00EEtre. Le Ma\u00EEtre-Sage Gymner est mort...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner Gardenuages\n\u0022Vous... Vous m\u0027avez vaincu. Mo... Morok saura me venger ! Vous allez subir... Le courroux des Clans !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "D\u00E9monologue \n\u0022Voyez ! Le Portail s\u0027ouvre ! Bethrezen sera bient\u00F4t libre de sa prison infernale ! Notre ma\u00EEtre nous revient enfin !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "D\u00E9monologue \n\u0022Qu... Quoi ? Qu\u0027est-ce ? Un enfant ? O\u00F9 est le grand d\u00E9mon qui commandait les l\u00E9gions des Enfers ? O\u00F9 est Bethrezen s\u0027il n\u0027est emprisonn\u00E9 ici ? Notre chef, que nous attendons depuis si longtemps, nous aurait-il abandonn\u00E9s ?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Aide des mort-vivants",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Invocateur \n\u0022Ma\u00EEtre, les Hordes de Mort-vivants ont us\u00E9 de sorcellerie sur Gymner... Voudraient-ils nous aider \u00E0 lib\u00E9rer Bethrezen ? Quel peut bien \u00EAtre leur dessein ?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner Gardenuages\n\u0022Vos tentatives pour m\u0027arr\u00EAter resteront vaines ! Les Clans ne peuvent \u00EAtre corrompus et votre dieu mal\u00E9fique restera emprisonn\u00E9 pour l\u0027\u00E9ternit\u00E9...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Invocateur \n\u0022Gymner a entam\u00E9 le c\u00E9r\u00E9monial... Nous devons frapper imm\u00E9diatement, le temps est venu !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN002f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN0030",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "T1 Avertissement",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nain\n\u0022Quoi ? Des d\u00E9mons, ici ? Quittez ces terres avant que nous ne vous \u00E9crasions ! Ce sont les terres des Clans des Nains. Partez tant que vous le pouvez...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Adepte\n\u0022Ma\u00EEtre, devons-nous tuer le messager nain avant qu\u0027il ne pr\u00E9vienne ses cong\u00E9n\u00E8res de notre pr\u00E9sence ? Il doit \u00EAtre arr\u00EAt\u00E9 !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Messager nain",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Conseiller\n\u0022Le messager nain est arriv\u00E9 \u00E0 destination, ma\u00EEtre... Je crains que les Clans ne soient d\u00E9sormais au courant de notre pr\u00E9sence !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Victoire qu\u00EAte 2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bethrezen \n\u0022Ne me reconnaissez-vous donc pas ? Rampez devant le ma\u00EEtre des Enfers !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "D\u00E9truire Garde 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Conseiller \n\u0022Nous avons captur\u00E9 et an\u00E9anti un garde... Le Portail ne doit plus \u00EAtre loin ! Nous devons cependant rester aux aguets ; plus nous approchons du but, plus les ennemis sont f\u00E9roces...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mouvement de Nain",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Garde nain \n\u0022Au diable, cr\u00E9atures ! Les monstres comme vous ne sont pas admis ! Passez votre chemin ou mourez...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Messager nain tu\u00E9",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Conseiller \n\u0022Nous avons tu\u00E9 le messager, ma\u00EEtre. Si nous parvenons \u00E0 nous d\u00E9barrasser du fils du Haut-Roi avant qu\u0027il ne referme les portes des Enfers, nous pourrons lib\u00E9rer Bethrezen !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "G\u00E9ants libres",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Echec qu\u00EAte T85",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner Gardenuages \n\u0022Ah ah ah ! Le c\u00E9r\u00E9monial est termin\u00E9 ! Le Portail restera clos pour le si\u00E8cle \u00E0 venir !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner  T40",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Adepte \n\u0022Regardez ! Un message de Gymner vient de nous parvenir !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Messager nain \n\u0022Quittez ces terres, cr\u00E9atures impies ! Vous ne parviendrez jamais \u00E0 interrompre la c\u00E9r\u00E9monie de Gymner. Le sort de Bethrezen est d\u00E9j\u00E0 scell\u00E9...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Message T8",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Conseiller \n\u0022Ces Nains au front bas ne semblent pas au courant de notre pr\u00E9sence en ces lieux, ma\u00EEtre. Nous devons profiter de l\u0027effet de surprise !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner T70",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner Gardenuages \n\u0022C\u0027est la fin pour vous, d\u00E9mons. Le Portail est presque scell\u00E9... Je m\u0027occuperai de vous apr\u00E8s la c\u00E9r\u00E9monie !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Adepte \n\u0022Plus vite, ma\u00EEtre ! Si Gymner r\u00E9ussit, nous sommes perdus !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN004f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Chef de bande",
